The avatar models and animations in this folder are derived from three packs by Quaternius
(https://quaternius.com), each released under:

CC0 1.0 Universal (CC0 1.0)
Public Domain Dedication
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

- Universal Animation Library [Standard]
- Universal Base Characters [Standard]
- Modular Character Outfits - Fantasy [Standard]

The License.txt / License_Standard.txt files inside each downloaded pack state this CC0 licence
verbatim ("License: CC0 1.0 Universal (CC0 1.0) Public Domain Dedication ... Models by
@Quaternius"). Attribution is not required; we credit Quaternius anyway.
